p of his career for  decades now and he's not going anywhere  apparently directors were more than  happy to welcome Jackson back into his  role and let's just say that the feeling  was mutual it's no secret that Jackson  loves playing the role of Frozone which  is why he's super open to filming a  third Incredibles movie while the actor  is quietly pushing for an origin story  he'd be open to any plot Brad Bird comes  up with since the original Incredibles  movie first came out in 2004 many of its  main characters lost faith in whether  the film sequel would ever come to life  but after more than a decade it was  announced that the supers were back in  action  whatever may happen Jackson is on the  ball and ready for more and while we're  thrilled to hear it we hope all the  actors on board feel the exact same way  after all The Incredibles wouldn't be  the same without its original cast in  hilarious personalities hey leave a  snowflake in the comments if Frozone is  your favorite super but not everyone  else is when you think about it The  Incredibles franchise wouldn't be the  same without the one and only Brad Bird  this legendary Hollywood writer is a  two-time oscar-winning director who has  more than a few achievements under his  belt so believe us when we tell you that  the Incredibles 3 wouldn't be the same  without him funny enough he seems to be  the only one who's reluctant in making  another sequel in bird's opinion the  worst thing he could do for The  Incredibles franchise is create a third  movie that follows a similar plot line  but unfortunately this seems to be what  the public wants regardless bird will  surely join the production once the  Incredibles 3 movie becomes a shoe-in  except he won't be working on anything  predictable bird has made it clear that  bigger and better is the only way to go  while he'd love to take a long vacation  from The Incredibles fans are reluctant  to wait another decade or so for this  movie to come out and hey we 